{"beats": [{"id": "b1", "pause_after_ms": 300, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.6, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Yes. I'm a reptilian. Seven feet, cold-blooded, old bloodline. I run the planet. Middle management.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b2", "pause_after_ms": 300, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "People think we drink blood and hoard gold. No. We drink coffee and hoard meeting notes.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b3", "pause_after_ms": 1000, "performance": {"expression": "annoyed", "gesture": "small gesture", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.7, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "This human suit itches. The eyelids slip when I lie. You saw it on video. That was me.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b4", "pause_after_ms": 1500, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.9, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "You think shape-shifting is glamorous. It's Spanx. For your entire soul. With eye contacts that dry out.", "type": "punchline"}, {"id": "b5", "pause_after_ms": 500, "performance": {"expression": "confused", "gesture": "shrug", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.6, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "The base is lovely. Warm rocks. No AC. You keep it sixty-eight degrees. That's a fridge.", "type": "tag"}, {"id": "b6", "pause_after_ms": 300, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "My job is bloodlines. Thirteen families. They all married each other. HR won't let me say that.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b7", "pause_after_ms": 1000, "performance": {"expression": "annoyed", "gesture": "small gesture", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.7, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "I filed for transfer to Dulce twice. Denied twice. Reason: you laugh too hard, suit drops.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b8", "pause_after_ms": 1500, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.9, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "So here I am. Compliance training. For the species I enslave. I failed the quiz.", "type": "punchline"}, {"id": "b9", "pause_after_ms": 300, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "You want proof? Watch my eyes. I love quarterly planning.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b10", "pause_after_ms": 800, "performance": {"expression": "surprised", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.8, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "See? Slit.", "type": "punchline"}, {"id": "b11", "pause_after_ms": 1200, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "lean in", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 1.0, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Warm rock. Now.", "type": "closer"}], "metadata": {"beat_count": 11, "punchline_count": 3, "total_duration_ms": 61000, "word_count": 145}, "profile": {"energy": 0.55, "eye_contact": 0.9, "gesture_frequency": 0.25, "movement": 0.3, "pace": 0.88, "punchline_hold_ms": 1200}, "version": "freaktown.delivery.v1", "voice": {"provider": "edge-tts", "voice_id": "en-US-ChristopherNeural"}}